<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/brand/favicon-32x32.png?v=4"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="16x16" href="/assets/brand/favicon-16x16.png?v=4"><link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/brand/apple-touch-icon.png?v=4"><link rel="shortcut icon" href="/favicon.ico?v=4"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="public-discovery about-page">
  <%- include('partials/public-header') %>
  <main class="about-shell">
    <section class="about-hero">
      <h1>A clearer way to find what is happening on campus.</h1>
      <p>YCEP brings campus events across YABATECH into one shared, public space—helping students, faculty, and campus communities stay informed and connected.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-principles" aria-labelledby="platform-overview">
      <div class="about-section-heading">
        <span class="eyebrow">Platform Overview</span>
        <h2 id="platform-overview">Built for clarity and accountability.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="about-card-grid">
        <article class="about-card">
          <span class="about-card__number">01</span>
          <h3>Centralized discovery</h3>
          <p>Access department programs, student association activities, and campus-wide events without scouring scattered groups or bulletin boards.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="about-card">
          <span class="about-card__number">02</span>
          <h3>Management review</h3>
          <p>Every event is drafted by an authorized organizer and reviewed by YABATECH Management before it appears on the public calendar.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="about-card">
          <span class="about-card__number">03</span>
          <h3>Open campus access</h3>
          <p>Discovering events is completely public. Audience filters are relevance guides, never barriers to exploring what is happening.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-flow" aria-labelledby="how-it-works">
      <div class="about-flow__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">How YCEP Works</span>
        <h2 id="how-it-works">Clear for visitors.<br>Structured for organizers.</h2>
        <p>YCEP connects the campus through a shared public calendar while keeping event publishing accountable and reviewed.</p>
        <div class="about-flow__actions">
          <a class="btn-primary" href="/">Discover events</a>
          <a class="btn-secondary" href="/login">Organizer sign in</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="about-flow__tracks">
        <div class="about-track">
          <h3 class="about-track__heading">For Campus Visitors</h3>
          <ol class="about-track__steps">
            <li>
              <span>1</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Browse &amp; Search</strong>
                <p>Find upcoming campus events by date, category, department, or level without needing an account.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>2</span>
              <div>
                <strong>View Event Details</strong>
                <p>Check schedules, venue locations, organizer details, and official cancellation notices when plans change.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>3</span>
              <div>
                <strong>External Registration</strong>
                <p>When required by an organizer, follow the reviewed HTTPS link directly to external registration services.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="about-track">
          <h3 class="about-track__heading">For Event Organizers</h3>
          <ol class="about-track__steps">
            <li>
              <span>1</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Get Authorized</strong>
                <p>Create a verified student account and apply for organizer privileges reviewed by Management.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>2</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Draft &amp; Submit</strong>
                <p>Prepare event details, target audiences, optional poster, and submit for Management review.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li>
              <span>3</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Publication &amp; Notices</strong>
                <p>Management approval publishes the event to the campus calendar. If plans change, organizers can issue an official cancellation notice.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about-closing">
      <span class="eyebrow">Operational Standards</span>
      <h2>Trust, transparency, and dependable notices.</h2>
      <p>Published events reflect reviewed submissions from authorized campus organizers. If plans shift or an event cannot hold, official cancellation reasons are displayed publicly, and past notices remain accessible in calendar history so the campus community always has reliable information.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="about-signature">
      <a href="http://daveolana.tech/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" aria-label="Portfolio">
        <img src="/assets/brand/developer-logo.png" alt="" width="32" height="32" class="about-signature__logo">
      </a>
    </div>
  </main>
  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
